.TH FOREST-SETTINGS 1 "July 2026" "forest" "Forest desktop environment"
.SH NAME
forest-settings \- Forest settings application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forest-settings
.RI [ page ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B forest-settings
is the standalone settings application for the Forest desktop
environment. It loads settings plugins for its sidebar panels, letting
the user configure appearance, plugins, and other desktop behavior. It
is styled using the active Forest theme's
.IR settings.css .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I page
Optional name of a settings page/category to open initially, instead
of the settings home screen.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forest (1)
